# Force LF line endings everywhere. The index already stores LF; Windows
# editors had been adding CRLF on checkout, generating noisy diffs on every
# `git status` run from this WSL setup.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Belt-and-suspenders binary tags (text=auto already auto-detects, but being
# explicit keeps git from ever guessing wrong on these).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.h5 binary
*.bin binary
*.parquet binary
*.pickle binary
*.pkl binary
*.so binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
